{"info": {"address1": "Century House", "address2": "P-15/1, Taratala Road", "city": "Kolkata", "zip": "700088", "country": "India", "phone": "91 33 3940 3950", "fax": "91 33 2248 3539", "website": "https://www.centuryply.com", "industry": "Lumber & Wood Production", "industryKey": "lumber-wood-production", "industryDisp": "Lumber & Wood Production", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "Century Plyboards (India) Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of plywood, laminates, decorative veneers, medium density fiber boards (MDF), pre-laminated boards, particle boards, and flush doors in India. It operates through Plywood, Laminate, MDF, Plain Particle Board, CFS Services, and Others segments. The company provides plywood, blockboard, veneer, and timber; decorative laminates; and plain and pre-laminated medium density fibre boards, as well as particle boards. It also provides container freight stations services; trades in chemicals and panel products; and offers pre-engineered doors, fibre cement boards, and PVC sheets. The company also exports its products. It provides its products primarily under the ARCHITECT PLY, CENTURYEXPERIA, CENTURYTEAK, SAINIK 710, SAINIK MR, SAINIK DOORS, SAINIK LAMINATES, CENTURYDOORS, CENTURYPROWUD, CENTURYLAMINATES, CENTURYVENEERS, Zykron, and CENTURYPLY brands. Century Plyboards (India) Limited was incorporated in 1982 and is headquartered in Kolkata, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sajjan  Bhajanka", "age": 73, "title": "Chairman of the Board & MD", "yearBorn": 1952, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 30500000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Agarwal", "age": 64, "title": "MD, CEO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1961, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 30500000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Arun Kumar Julasaria", "age": 63, "title": "Chief Finan